 <h2 id="transfers">Airport Transfers to and from Riyadh Airport</h2>
-<p>While the airport is closed, we cannot run pickups or drop-offs at RUH. If you've booked a Riyadh airport transfer with us, message us with your airline's latest update. We'll move the pickup to your new flight time, or quote the new journey if your airline has rebooked you through a different airport. No payment is needed to receive a quote.</p>
-<p>Once the airport reopens, our guides to <a href="/blog/riyadh-airport-driver-meeting-point">meeting your driver at Riyadh Airport</a> and <a href="/blog/what-happens-if-flight-to-saudi-arabia-delayed">what to do if your flight to Saudi Arabia is delayed</a> explain how pickups adjust to changed flight times.</p>
+<p>We are not confirming pickups or drop-offs at King Khalid International Airport in advance while its operations are disrupted; any airport pickup or drop-off is confirmed case by case in your quotation. If you've booked a Riyadh airport transfer with us, message us with your airline's latest update and we'll review the booking with you, or quote the new journey if your airline has rebooked you through a different airport. No payment is needed to receive a quote.</p>
 
